{"unit_id":"Stella-Mira__muse_vtuber#card-zh","repo":"Stella-Mira/muse_vtuber","commit":"53e992bbc002f73e349efbdd35d31105c75a01ff","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"muse_vtuber 是 DSH 网页客户端的形象展示插件，为对话界面添加 LIVE2D 形象页签和设置页。它在宿主注册会话视图与设置区域，并通过工具、HTTP 接口和事件流同步外观状态。用户可以查看模型与可用表情动作，切换模型、表情和动作组，也可显示或隐藏形象；没有模型时界面仍显示频谱环。视频和音频侧栏读取 mira_device 提供的数据，说话状态由 mira_media 提供。适合希望在 DSH 网页界面展示和控制虚拟形象的用户。需要 DSH 的 webServer、tools、miraMedia、miraDevice 插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:40-41","lib/index.js:244-249","lib/tools.js:47-190","lib/client.js:1470-1490"]}
{"unit_id":"Stella-Mira__muse_vtuber#card-en","repo":"Stella-Mira/muse_vtuber","commit":"53e992bbc002f73e349efbdd35d31105c75a01ff","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"muse_vtuber adds a LIVE2D avatar panel to DSH's web client. Tools switch models, expressions, motions, and visibility; a spectrum ring appears without a model. Video and audio use mira_device; speech state comes from mira_media. Requires DSH webServer, tools, miraMedia, and miraDevice.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:40-41","lib/index.js:244-249","lib/tools.js:47-190","lib/client.js:1470-1490"]}
